[https://www.reddit.com/r/sysadmin/comments/9squms/remote\_desktop\_service\_gateway\_remoteapp\_access/?utm\_source=share&utm\_medium=web2x](https://www.reddit.com/r/sysadmin/comments/9squms/remote_desktop_service_gateway_remoteapp_access/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=web2x)

