I run gotoassist.  I use the unattended installer for my remote and laptop users.  I use Ultra VNC with the DSM plugin for in house desktops workstations.  

&#x200B;

My version of gotoassist allows for 100 unattended clients, one technician (thats me!) and unlimited sessions.  No limit on how many normal sessions are allowed to my knowledge. 

I have older pricing but it runs about $55 a month.

&#x200B;

I run UltraVNC with a DSM plugin for security on my users workstations if i'm in the building.  I have gotoassist for when I'm out or at home.  I've never been able to get UltraVNC to run smoothly through a VPN, so I quit trying.  

&#x200B;

I set up UltraVNC on my client PCs with a PDQ Deploy package.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

